        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the eccentric laboratory of <strong>Doctor Rulo</strong> with <strong>TapMazing</strong>, an engaging game where you guide <strong>Po-G</strong>, a whimsical slime hero, through a vibrant and challenging world. Inspired by scientific experimentation and slimy ingenuity, this game blends fun with strategic depth. Explore a lab brimming with surprises, where each tap reveals a new twist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay and Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TapMazing</strong> combines skill and strategy across diverse game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracks:</strong> Master smooth paths with no obstacles to hone your tapping precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gauntlets:</strong> Tackle twisting routes packed with obstacles, demanding skillful navigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenger Hunts:</strong> Hunt for hidden cookie pieces, split into four parts, within compact mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mazes:</strong> Conquer expansive mazes filled with obstacles, seeking a single hidden cookie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More to Come:</strong> Anticipate future updates with exciting new modes on the horizon!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode challenges your reflexes and offers a unique experience, suitable for players of all skill levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulties</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doctor Rulo</strong> offers four distinct difficulty levels to choose from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slime:</strong> Perfect for beginners to learn the basics, where obstacles sting and electric gates can end your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Volt:</strong> Walls crackle with electricity, causing damage on contact—ideal for intermediate players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lava:</strong> Walls turn to lethal lava, instantly ending Po-G’s journey with a single hit, suited for experienced players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acid:</strong> Walls dissolve Po-G into acid, forcing a restart from the mode’s beginning—perfect for hardcore enthusiasts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize Po-G to reflect your style with a variety of customization options!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant color palette featuring shades like Amber, Vermilion, and Jasmine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique skins and accessories to enhance your slime hero’s look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Po-G’s core to match your preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More customization slots are coming <strong>soon</strong>!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements by demonstrating your prowess!</p>",
